#10814
worker ant off duty~
an off-duty worker ant~
This worker ant is not on duty and quite glad.
~
This ant is on the only thing it has to live for, a break.  It happily munches
a small piece of blueberry and allows its legs to stop moving.  It ignores you
completely and continues to eat.  Despite the fact it has no humanoid face,
you get the sense it is quite relieved.
~
