soldier ant large~
a soldier ant~
This large ant is patrolling the colony.
~
This ant is much larger than the workers or builders.  It keeps a constant
vigil for any sign of trouble, from the attacks or spies of a rival colony to
the ever present threat of a spider or termite invasion.  Its carapace looks
solid and its mandibles look quite strong.
~
