#10837
builder ant~
a builder ant~
This medium sized ant is apparently in charge of maintaining the tunnels.
~
This ant is busy packing the dirt of the tunnel walls as best it can.  It
simply pushes its head against the walls to ensure that the dirt stays hard.
This builder ant is larger than the other workers but does not seem to compete
with the soldier ants.
~
