#10848
ant matron~
an ant matron~
This ant is in charge of taking care of the young.
~
This small worker ant has been given a position of relative comfort.  Its job
is to take the recently hatched larvae up to its respective caste home until
it is old enough to begin work.  The matron carries food on the hairs of its
