#10852
ant prince~
an ant prince~
This male ant greedily devours a bit of royal jelly.
~
This ant is one of the only males in the entire colony.  He has but one of two
choices in his life.  He will either stay inside the colony to be the consort
of the queen, or he will spread his wings and fly out as far as he can go,
looking for a suitable female to start a new hive.
~
