This large alcove has been carefully constructed by packing the dirt hard
against the sides.  Judging by the add designs and tracks on the walls and
ceiling, it is obvious the builders are quite comfortable working upside down.
The ground is littered with collections of half-eaten food, carcasses, and
even rusted equipment.
~
0 9 13
D0
Exit description~
~
0 0 10822
D1
Exit description~
~
