#10880
The Royal Grounds~
This alcove has been made specifically for the ant royalty.  The only males in
the colony reside here, their crystalline wings laid back against their
bodies. They live a life of luxury, a steady supply of food and royal jelly is
brought to them.  They lounge about, waiting for the time they are called into
service.
~
